        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo Yehoshafati yatwete atyo Yuda. Kugya kulya engoma hakaba aina emyaka 35. Aha ngoma akamaraho emyaka 25 ayemire Yerusalemu. Nyina eibaralye ni Azuba, muhara wa Shiliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarondora Asa ishe kakimoi, yashemeleza Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai obuju bw'aha mabanga tiyabukambwire; abantu bakaba bataketaireho Ruhanga wa baish'enkurubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi ebyo Yehoshafati yakozire, kwema aha mbandizo kuhika aha nzindo bihandikirwe omu Kitabo ky'Amakuru ga Yehu eya Hanani, amakuru agahandikire omu Kitabo ky'Abakama ba Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ahanyuma Yehoshafati omukama wa Yuda ayekwata Ahazia omukama wa Isiraeli enkora bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwekwata, bema hamoi kukora emeli z'okusabara Tarishishi, n'ezindi bazikolera Esiongeberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Elieza eya Dodavahu owa Maresha aranga nakeena Yehoshafati ati, “Orwo oyekwete Ahazia, eby'okozire Omukama arabisilikya.” Emeli zikasinjagulika, Tarishishi tizagireyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.20.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
